{j=1}^m f_j\\right\\|_1\n\\le\\prod_{j=1}^m\\|f_j\\|_{p_j},\n\\qquad\\sum_{j=1}^m\\frac1{p_j}=1.\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math inline\">1\\le p_j\\le\\infty</span>；无穷指数的因子用本质上确界控制。两因子时，就是 <span class=\"math inline\">\\|fg\\|_1\\le\\|f\\|_p\\|g\\|_{p'}</span>。</p>\n<p>详见 <a href=\"#/learn/ra.holder-inequality?anchor=definition\">Hölder 不等式（Hölder inequality）</a>，包括参数伸缩的另一证法、简单函数和有限测度上的推论。</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-holder-complete.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"minkowski-不等式\"></a></p>\n<h2>Minkowski：范数的三角不等式</h2>\n<p>对于 <span class=\"math inline\">f,g\\in L^p</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\|f+g\\|_p\\le\\|f\\|_p+\\|g\\|_p,\n\\qquad1\\le p\\le\\infty.\n</div>\n<p>这就是范数的<strong>三角不等式</strong>（triangle inequality）。有限多个向量或函数反复使用它，得到“和的范数不超过范数之和”；连续的一族函数用积分相加，则对应积分 Minkowski 不等式。</p>\n<p>证明仍使用归一化技术：把两个函数的范数化为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>，直接应用 Hölder，再积分。详见 <a href=\"#/learn/ra.minkowski-inequality?anchor=definition\">Minkowski 不等式（Minkowski inequality）</a>。</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-minkowski-complete.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"summary\"></a></p>\n<h2>串起这三步</h2>\n<p>琴生比较两个平均高度；对数把它变成 Young 的乘积界。归一化后汇总逐点控制，得到 Hölder；再用 Hölder 控制相加后的范数，得到 Minkowski。</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-summary.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"terminology\"></a></p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>共轭指数</td>\n<td>conjugate exponents</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权算术平均</td>\n<td>weighted arithmetic mean</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权几何平均</td>\n<td>weighted geometric mean</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凹函数</td>\n<td>concave function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>琴生不等式</td>\n<td>Jensen's inequality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化技术</td>\n<td>normalization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>齐次性</td>\n<td>homogeneity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角不等式</td>\n<td>triangle inequality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几乎处处</td>\n<td>almost everywhere</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本质上确界</td>\n<td>essential supremum</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>参考：<a href=\"#reference-zhou-real-functions\">周民强《实变函数论》</a>。</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/inequalities-complete.mp4\">完整讲解视频 / Complete lesson</a></p>\n\n<section class=\"bibliography\"><h2>参考资料</h2><ol>\n<li id=\"reference-zhou-real-functions\">实变函数论 / Theory of Real Functions — 周民强 · 2008 · 第二版; 第4.2节例6; 定理4.18、4.19（原稿定位） · .archive/legacy-workspace/MTree/docs/Library/《实变函数论第二版》周民强+北京大学2008年5月第2版.pdf</li>\n</ol></section>\n","id":"ra.inequalities.main","legacy":false,"node_id":"ra.inequalities","resources":[{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-route.mp4","id":"ineq-clip-route","owner_id":"ra.inequalities","poster_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-route.jpg","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-route.mp4","render_state":"source-ready","title":"从平均、重心，到归一化技术","type":"video"},{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-young-complete.mp4","id":"ineq-young-complete","owner_id":"ra.inequalities","poster_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-young-complete.jpg","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-young-complete.mp4","render_state":"source-ready","title":"Young：本节点完整讲解 / Node Lesson","type":"video"},{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-holder-complete.mp4","id":"ineq-holder-complete","owner_id":"ra.inequalities","poster_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-holder-complete.jpg","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-holder-complete.mp4","render_state":"source-ready","title":"Holder：本节点完整讲解 / Node Lesson","type":"video"},{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-minkowski-complete.mp4","id":"ineq-minkowski-complete","owner_id":"ra.inequalities","poster_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-minkowski-complete.jpg","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-minkowski-complete.mp4","render_state":"source-ready","title":"Minkowski：本节点完整讲解 / Node Lesson","type":"video"},{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-summary.mp4","id":"ineq-clip-summary","owner_id":"ra.inequalities","poster_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-summary.jpg","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-summary.mp4","render_state":"source-ready","title":"平均、重心与归一化的共同主线","type":"video"},{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/inequalities-complete.mp4","id":"inequalities-complete-video","owner_id":"ra.inequalities","poster_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/inequalities-complete.jpg","preview_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/inequalities-complete.mp4","render_state":"source-ready","title":"Young、Hölder 与 Minkowski：完整讲解 / Complete Lesson","type":"video"}],"schema_version":1,"title":"Young、Hölder 与 Minkowski 不等式"}],"available_articles":[{"anchors":["conjugate-exponents","definition","hölder-不等式","minkowski-不等式","summary","terminology","young-不等式","不等式-inequalities","共轭指数-conjugate-indices"],"english_title":"Young, Hölder and Minkowski Inequalities","id":"ra.inequalities.main","legacy":false,"node_id":"ra.inequalities","title":"Young、Hölder 与 Minkowski 不等式"}],"bibliography":[{"author":"周民强","id":"zhou-real-functions","locator":"第二版; 第4.2节例6; 定理4.18、4.19（原稿定位）","source_path":".archive/legacy-workspace/MTree/docs/Library/《实变函数论第二版》周民强+北京大学2008年5月第2版.pdf","title":"实变函数论 / Theory of Real Functions","url":"","year":"2008"}],"contains":["opt.jensen-inequality","ra.young-inequality","ra.holder-inequality","ra.minkowski-inequality"],"content_status":"complete","default_articles":["ra.inequalities.main"],"english_title":"Young, Hölder and Minkowski Inequalities","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p><a id=\"不等式-inequalities\"></a></p>\n<h1>Young、Hölder 与 Minkowski 不等式</h1>\n<p>这三个不等式沿着同一条思路展开：从重心读懂琴生不等式，再用对数凹性控制乘积；归一化后得到求和与积分的控制，最后得到范数的三角不等式。</p>\n<p><a id=\"共轭指数-conjugate-indices\"></a>\n<a id=\"conjugate-exponents\"></a></p>\n<h2>共轭指数（conjugate exponents）</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math inline\">1\\le p,p'\\le\\infty</span> 且</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\frac1p+\\frac1{p'}=1,\n</div>\n<p>则称 <span class=\"math inline\">p,p'</span> 为一对<strong>共轭指数</strong>，约定 <span class=\"math inline\">1/\\infty=0</span>。当 <span class=\"math inline\">1&lt;p&lt;\\infty</span> 时，<span class=\"math inline\">p'=p/(p-1)</span>；端点处，<span class=\"math inline\">1</span> 与 <span class=\"math inline\">\\infty</span> 互为共轭指数。</p>\n<p>多个因子对应的条件是 <span class=\"math inline\">\\sum_{j=1}^m1/p_j=1</span>，即各个指数的倒数共同分配总量 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。</p>\n<p>下面的函数均取在同一个测度空间 <span class=\"math inline\">(\\Omega,\\mu)</span> 上。记</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\|f\\|_p=\\left(\\int_\\Omega|f|^p\\,d\\mu\\right)^{1/p}\n\\quad(1\\le p&lt;\\infty).\n</div>\n<p><span class=\"math inline\">\\|f\\|_\\infty</span> 是 <span class=\"math inline\">|f|</span> 的本质上确界，即允许忽略零测集后的最小上界。相应空间见 <a href=\"#/learn/ra.lp-spaces?anchor=definition\"><span class=\"math inline\">L^p</span> 空间（<span class=\"math inline\">L^p</span> spaces）</a>。</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-route.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"young-不等式\"></a></p>\n<h2>Young：对数凹性控制乘积</h2>\n<p>对于非负数 <span class=\"math inline\">u_1,\\ldots,u_m</span> 和正权重 <span class=\"math inline\">\\theta_j</span>，若 <span class=\"math inline\">\\sum_j\\theta_j=1</span>，则</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\prod_{j=1}^m u_j^{\\theta_j}\n\\le\\sum_{j=1}^m\\theta_j u_j.\n</div>\n<p>关键是<a href=\"#/learn/opt.jensen-inequality?anchor=barycenter\">琴生不等式（Jensen's inequality）</a>：凹函数上各点的加权重心，不高于曲线上同一横坐标的点。先对正数取 <span class=\"math inline\">f=\\ln</span> 再取指数，零值由连续性补上，就得到这个乘积界。</p>\n<p>完整的重心解释、切线推导与幂形式串联在 <a href=\"#/learn/ra.young-inequality?anchor=young-concavity\">Young 不等式（Young inequality）</a> 中。</p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-young-complete.jpg\" alt=\"本节公式与图示 / Section figure\"/></p>\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-young-complete.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"hölder-不等式\"></a></p>\n<h2>Hölder：归一化后求和或积分</h2>\n<p><strong>归一化技术</strong>（normalization）是把每组数或每个函数除以各自的总量。各组总量变成 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span> 后，逐点使用多变量 Young，再求和或积分，右边也等于 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>。把尺度乘回去，得到</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\left\\|\\prod_{j=1}^m f_j\\right\\|_1\n\\le\\prod_{j=1}^m\\|f_j\\|_{p_j},\n\\qquad\\sum_{j=1}^m\\frac1{p_j}=1.\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math inline\">1\\le p_j\\le\\infty</span>；无穷指数的因子用本质上确界控制。两因子时，就是 <span class=\"math inline\">\\|fg\\|_1\\le\\|f\\|_p\\|g\\|_{p'}</span>。</p>\n<p>详见 <a href=\"#/learn/ra.holder-inequality?anchor=definition\">Hölder 不等式（Hölder inequality）</a>，包括参数伸缩的另一证法、简单函数和有限测度上的推论。</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-holder-complete.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"minkowski-不等式\"></a></p>\n<h2>Minkowski：范数的三角不等式</h2>\n<p>对于 <span class=\"math inline\">f,g\\in L^p</span>，</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\|f+g\\|_p\\le\\|f\\|_p+\\|g\\|_p,\n\\qquad1\\le p\\le\\infty.\n</div>\n<p>这就是范数的<strong>三角不等式</strong>（triangle inequality）。有限多个向量或函数反复使用它，得到“和的范数不超过范数之和”；连续的一族函数用积分相加，则对应积分 Minkowski 不等式。</p>\n<p>证明仍使用归一化技术：把两个函数的范数化为 <span class=\"math inline\">1</span>，直接应用 Hölder，再积分。详见 <a href=\"#/learn/ra.minkowski-inequality?anchor=definition\">Minkowski 不等式（Minkowski inequality）</a>。</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-minkowski-complete.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"summary\"></a></p>\n<h2>串起这三步</h2>\n<p>琴生比较两个平均高度；对数把它变成 Young 的乘积界。归一化后汇总逐点控制，得到 Hölder；再用 Hölder 控制相加后的范数，得到 Minkowski。</p>\n\n<details>\n<summary>本节动画 / Section animation</summary>\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-summary.mp4\">播放本节动画 / Watch this section</a></p>\n</details>\n\n<p><a id=\"terminology\"></a></p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>共轭指数</td>\n<td>conjugate exponents</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权算术平均</td>\n<td>weighted arithmetic mean</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权几何平均</td>\n<td>weighted geometric mean</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>凹函数</td>\n<td>concave function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>琴生不等式</td>\n<td>Jensen's inequality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归一化技术</td>\n<td>normalization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>齐次性</td>\n<td>homogeneity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三角不等式</td>\n<td>triangle inequality</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>几乎处处</td>\n<td>almost everywhere</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本质上确界</td>\n<td>essential supremum</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>参考：<a href=\"#reference-zhou-real-functions\">周民强《实变函数论》</a>。</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/inequalities-complete.mp4\">完整讲解视频 / Complete lesson</a></p>\n\n<section class=\"bibliography\"><h2>参考资料</h2><ol>\n<li id=\"reference-zhou-real-functions\">实变函数论 / Theory of Real Functions — 周民强 · 2008 · 第二版; 第4.2节例6; 定理4.18、4.19（原稿定位） · .archive/legacy-workspace/MTree/docs/Library/《实变函数论第二版》周民强+北京大学2008年5月第2版.pdf</li>\n</ol></section>\n","id":"ra.inequalities","kind":"knowledge","objective":"从琴生不等式的重心解释出发，沿对数凹性与归一化理解 Young、Hölder 和 Minkowski 的证明联系。","prerequisites":["ra.lp-spaces"],"related":[],"requires":[],"resources":[{"asset_url":"/MTreeLab/assets/ra.inequalities/media/ineq-route.mp4","id":"ineq-clip-r